        <p class="role">Staff Technical Project Manager, Professional Services</p>
        <p class="dates">May 2026 to present</p>
        <ul>
          <li>I lead enterprise deployments of SentinelOne's AI-powered SIEM platform for large customers and reseller partners, running four implementations at once from kickoff to go-live.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <h3>Block (Square, Cash App, Afterpay)</h3>
        <p class="role">Senior Technical Project Manager, Customer Operations Technology Enablement</p>
        <p class="dates">Jul 2024 to May 2026</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Built an agent knowledge base with Claude Code, from side prototype to production approval. I wrote the web front end and the API-based migration of support articles from Zendesk into Contentful, and designed its role-based access. It launched to Afterpay's ~1,000 support agents. (<a href="/work/support-content-hub">Case study</a>)</li>
          <li>Led an AI enablement program for Customer Operations leads. It included AI tool training and a weekly leadership briefing, built with a Knowledge Management colleague: about 100 leads submit updates, and a scheduled Claude task compiles them into a summary for senior leadership.</li>
          <li>Led the migration of Afterpay's full support-content library (1,000+ articles, ~2,200 macros, 5 regions) off Zendesk ahead of a hard contract deadline. I kept 20+ stakeholders aligned through a mid-program reorg and wrote the requirements and the launch plan.</li>
